  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agro Expo fair Tbilisi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the framework of the activities to be executed under project MAP17GE01, an evaluation seminar in Georgia in November 2018 and a trade mission, this project contains the preparation and execution of a series of matchmaking sessions during the Agro Expo fair in Tbilisi.Additionally, the participating Dutch companies will have the opportunity to engage in company visits, where they will be connected with interested Georgian counterparts or potential partners.</narrative>
  </description>
